20% more pods means 100 * 1.20 = 120 pods. The price for 120 pods is $12. Therefore, the price per pod is $12 / 120 = $0.10 per pod.  The number of cycles you can run for $1 is $1 / $0.10 per pod = 10 cycles.

Thus, you can run 10 cycles for $1.
